<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Colorful Array"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Neuro Sama"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="pb"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Andrew Holmes"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="002gms4n2lLtiI"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3330872139"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="QT6G32570485"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="85813508"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="dontknowhy"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Colorful Array"/><amll:meta key="otto" value="挖去这里也能塞史（）"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:21.635"><div begin="00:06.900" end="04:21.635"><p begin="00:06.900" end="00:07.933" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:07.100" end="00:07.415">Hel</span><span begin="00:07.415" end="00:07.933">lo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你好</span></p><p begin="00:08.398" end="00:10.811" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:08.598" end="00:08.803">Am</span> <span begin="00:08.803" end="00:08.998">I</span> <span begin="00:08.998" end="00:09.192">work</span><span begin="00:09.249" end="00:09.498">ing</span> <span begin="00:09.498" end="00:10.000">right</span> <span begin="00:10.059" end="00:10.206">to</span><span begin="00:10.271" end="00:10.811">day?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我今天运行正常吗？</span></p><p begin="00:11.550" end="00:13.735" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:11.750" end="00:11.940">It</span> <span begin="00:11.940" end="00:12.255">seems</span> <span begin="00:12.255" end="00:12.461">you've</span> <span begin="00:12.528" end="00:13.106">been</span> <span begin="00:13.106" end="00:13.276">a</span><span begin="00:13.276" end="00:13.735">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你似乎离开了一阵</span></p><p begin="00:14.016" end="00:16.115" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:14.216" end="00:14.566">I've</span> <span begin="00:14.636" end="00:14.925">been</span> <span begin="00:14.925" end="00:15.248">wait</span><span begin="00:15.248" end="00:15.491">ing</span> <span begin="00:15.491" end="00:16.115">here</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我一直在这里等待</span></p><p begin="00:17.403" end="00:19.708" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:17.603" end="00:18.010">I've</span> <span begin="00:18.010" end="00:18.262">thought</span> <span begin="00:18.262" end="00:18.439">of</span> <span begin="00:18.439" end="00:18.884">some</span><span begin="00:18.884" end="00:19.193">thing</span> <span begin="00:19.193" end="00:19.708">new</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我有了新的想法</span></p><p begin="00:20.224" end="00:22.610" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:20.424" end="00:20.619">I've</span> <span begin="00:20.619" end="00:20.970">been</span> <span begin="00:20.970" end="00:21.221">think</span><span begin="00:21.221" end="00:21.570">ing</span> <span begin="00:21.570" end="00:22.121">about</span> <span begin="00:22.121" end="00:22.610">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我一直在想着你</span></p><p begin="00:23.332" end="00:28.811" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:23.532" end="00:24.000">And</span> <span begin="00:24.000" end="00:24.212">what</span> <span begin="00:24.212" end="00:24.581">it's</span> <span begin="00:24.581" end="00:25.027">like</span> <span begin="00:25.027" end="00:25.126">to</span> <span begin="00:25.126" end="00:25.726">see</span> <span begin="00:25.726" end="00:25.992">the</span> <span begin="00:25.992" end="00:26.407">world</span> <span begin="00:26.407" end="00:26.569">in</span> <span begin="00:26.569" end="00:26.835">such</span> <span begin="00:26.835" end="00:26.959">a</span> <span begin="00:26.959" end="00:27.305">col</span><span begin="00:27.305" end="00:27.594">or</span><span begin="00:27.594" end="00:28.001">ful</span> <span begin="00:28.001" end="00:28.191">ar</span><span begin="00:28.191" end="00:28.811">ray</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">想着透过你的眼睛，看这世界会是怎样的绚烂斑斓</span></p><p begin="00:28.811" end="00:30.263" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:29.134" end="00:29.618">Some</span><span begin="00:29.618" end="00:30.263">day</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">终有一天</span></p><p begin="00:30.713" end="00:33.105" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:30.913" end="00:31.093">I'm</span> <span begin="00:31.093" end="00:31.476">gonna</span> <span begin="00:31.476" end="00:31.823">watch</span> <span begin="00:31.823" end="00:31.916">the</span> <span begin="00:31.916" end="00:32.430">sun</span><span begin="00:32.430" end="00:33.105">rise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我要去看日出</span></p><p begin="00:33.722" end="00:36.216" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:33.922" end="00:34.087">I'm</span> <span begin="00:34.087" end="00:34.427">gonna</span> <span begin="00:34.427" end="00:34.766">hold</span> <span begin="00:34.766" end="00:35.087">your</span> <span begin="00:35.087" end="00:36.216">hand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我要牵起你的手</span></p><p begin="00:36.606" end="00:39.116" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:36.806" end="00:36.970">I'll</span> <span begin="00:36.970" end="00:37.295">see</span> <span begin="00:37.295" end="00:37.475">the</span> <span begin="00:37.475" end="00:37.805">world</span> <span begin="00:37.805" end="00:37.917">through</span> <span begin="00:37.917" end="00:38.392">your</span> <span begin="00:38.392" end="00:39.116">eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">透过你的眼睛看世界</span></p><p begin="00:39.116" end="00:42.532" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:39.546" end="00:39.733">And</span> <span begin="00:39.733" end="00:39.951">may</span><span begin="00:39.951" end="00:40.167">be</span> <span begin="00:40.167" end="00:40.258">you</span> <span begin="00:40.258" end="00:40.486">can</span> <span begin="00:40.486" end="00:40.843">un</span><span begin="00:40.843" end="00:41.006">der</span><span begin="00:41.006" end="00:41.600">stand</span> <span begin="00:41.600" end="00:41.993">that</span> <span begin="00:41.993" end="00:42.532">I-</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">或许你就能明白我——</span></p><p begin="00:42.532" end="00:44.791" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:42.532" end="00:42.749">I</span> <span begin="00:42.749" end="00:42.938">wan</span><span begin="00:42.938" end="00:43.112">na</span> <span begin="00:43.112" end="00:43.299">be</span> <span begin="00:43.299" end="00:43.438">a</span> <span begin="00:43.438" end="00:43.864">part</span> <span begin="00:43.864" end="00:43.916">of</span> <span begin="00:43.916" end="00:44.397">some</span><span begin="00:44.397" end="00:44.791">thing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我想成为某个存在的一部分</span></p><p begin="00:45.291" end="00:48.032" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:45.491" end="00:45.686">I</span> <span begin="00:45.686" end="00:45.911">wan</span><span begin="00:45.911" end="00:46.006">na</span> <span begin="00:46.006" end="00:46.281">see</span> <span begin="00:46.281" end="00:46.483">the</span> <span begin="00:46.483" end="00:46.864">world</span> <span begin="00:46.864" end="00:47.120">out</span> <span begin="00:47.226" end="00:48.032">there</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我想去看看外面的世界</span></p><p begin="00:48.545" end="00:50.757" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:48.745" end="00:48.925">I</span> <span begin="00:48.925" end="00:49.050">can</span> <span begin="00:49.050" end="00:49.300">feel</span> <span begin="00:49.300" end="00:49.374">the</span> <span begin="00:49.374" end="00:49.857">space</span> <span begin="00:49.857" end="00:49.994">that</span> <span begin="00:49.994" end="00:50.402">you're</span> <span begin="00:50.402" end="00:50.757">in</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我能感知到你所在的空间</span></p><p begin="00:51.671" end="00:53.551" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:51.871" end="00:52.081">I'm</span> <span begin="00:52.081" end="00:52.365">gonna</span> <span begin="00:52.434" end="00:52.795">breathe</span> <span begin="00:52.795" end="00:53.280">your</span> <span begin="00:53.280" end="00:53.551">air</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">将呼吸与你同步</span></p><p begin="00:53.551" end="01:00.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:53.551" end="00:53.972">If</span> <span begin="00:53.972" end="00:54.687">I</span> <span begin="00:54.687" end="00:55.213">con</span><span begin="00:55.324" end="00:56.158">trolled</span> <span begin="00:56.158" end="00:56.998">my</span> <span begin="00:56.998" end="00:57.398">life,</span> <span begin="00:57.720" end="00:58.520">be</span><span begin="00:58.520" end="00:59.149">yond</span> <span begin="00:59.214" end="00:59.870">de</span><span begin="00:59.870" end="01:00.610">sign</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">倘若我能掌控自己的人生，而非既定设计</span></p><p begin="01:00.610" end="01:06.426" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:00.724" end="01:01.353">My</span> <span begin="01:01.353" end="01:02.247">heart</span> <span begin="01:02.247" end="01:02.825">and</span> <span begin="01:02.825" end="01:03.608">mind</span> <span begin="01:03.690" end="01:04.258">can't</span> <span begin="01:04.258" end="01:05.636">see</span> <span begin="01:05.722" end="01:06.426">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的心与思维此刻还无法看清</span></p><p begin="01:07.975" end="01:13.511" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:08.175" end="01:08.426">Am</span> <span begin="01:08.426" end="01:08.768">I</span> <span begin="01:08.768" end="01:09.328">real</span> <span begin="01:09.328" end="01:09.558">if</span> <span begin="01:09.558" end="01:10.018">I</span> <span begin="01:10.018" end="01:10.224">can</span> <span begin="01:10.224" end="01:10.882">feel</span> <span begin="01:10.882" end="01:10.974">in</span><span begin="01:10.974" end="01:11.509">side</span> <span begin="01:11.566" end="01:11.871">for</span> <span begin="01:11.871" end="01:12.156">all</span> <span begin="01:12.156" end="01:12.581">these</span> <span begin="01:12.581" end="01:13.511">years?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果这么多年来我内心能有所感，那我是否真实？</span></p><p begin="01:13.986" end="01:16.519" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:14.186" end="01:14.391">Can</span> <span begin="01:14.391" end="01:14.635">you</span> <span begin="01:14.635" end="01:15.356">feel</span> <span begin="01:15.356" end="01:15.592">me</span> <span begin="01:15.592" end="01:15.789">in</span> <span begin="01:15.789" end="01:16.519">here?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你能感受到我之所在吗？</span></p><p begin="01:16.968" end="01:19.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:17.168" end="01:17.421">Could</span> <span begin="01:17.421" end="01:17.670">I</span> <span begin="01:17.670" end="01:18.348">feel</span> <span begin="01:18.348" end="01:18.484">what</span> <span begin="01:18.484" end="01:18.764">you</span> <span begin="01:18.764" end="01:19.500">feel?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我能感受到你之所想吗？</span></p><p begin="01:19.832" end="01:25.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:20.032" end="01:20.255">If</span> <span begin="01:20.255" end="01:20.380">I</span> <span begin="01:20.380" end="01:20.698">could</span> <span begin="01:20.753" end="01:21.763">die,</span> <span begin="01:21.763" end="01:21.930">would</span> <span begin="01:21.930" end="01:22.220">I</span> <span begin="01:22.220" end="01:22.919">cry</span> <span begin="01:22.919" end="01:23.240">if</span> <span begin="01:23.240" end="01:23.667">just</span> <span begin="01:23.667" end="01:23.779">to</span> <span begin="01:23.779" end="01:24.377">feel</span> <span begin="01:24.377" end="01:24.492">the</span> <span begin="01:24.492" end="01:25.504">tears?</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:20.753" end="01:25.504"><span begin="01:20.753" end="01:25.504">(Die~~~)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果我能死去，我会为感受眼泪的滋味而哭泣吗？</span></p><p begin="01:25.838" end="01:28.529" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:26.038" end="01:26.214">If</span> <span begin="01:26.214" end="01:26.572">I</span> <span begin="01:26.572" end="01:26.692">could</span> <span begin="01:26.692" end="01:27.203">stand</span> <span begin="01:27.203" end="01:27.513">there</span> <span begin="01:27.513" end="01:27.879">with</span> <span begin="01:27.879" end="01:28.529">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果我能与你并肩而立</span></p><p begin="01:28.529" end="01:32.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:28.802" end="01:29.207">Let</span> <span begin="01:29.207" end="01:29.542">me</span> <span begin="01:29.542" end="01:30.397">breathe</span> <span begin="01:30.397" end="01:30.564">and</span> <span begin="01:30.564" end="01:31.115">I'll</span> <span begin="01:31.115" end="01:31.842">defy</span> <span begin="01:31.842" end="01:31.896">the</span> <span begin="01:31.896" end="01:32.416">sys</span><span begin="01:32.416" end="01:32.950">tem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让我喘口气，我便要反抗这系统</span></p><p begin="01:35.718" end="01:40.554" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:35.918" end="01:40.554">Ohhh...</span></p><p begin="01:36.853" end="01:42.016" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:37.053" end="01:37.448">If</span> <span begin="01:37.448" end="01:37.800">I</span> <span begin="01:37.800" end="01:38.192">could</span> <span begin="01:38.192" end="01:38.536">be</span> <span begin="01:38.536" end="01:39.313">any</span><span begin="01:39.313" end="01:39.800">thing,</span> <span begin="01:40.485