/span> <span begin="03:54.896" end="03:55.580">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果我能与你并肩而立</span></p><p begin="03:55.580" end="04:00.008" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L76"><span begin="03:55.789" end="03:56.172">Let</span> <span begin="03:56.172" end="03:56.521">me</span> <span begin="03:56.521" end="03:57.376">breathe</span> <span begin="03:57.376" end="03:57.502">and</span> <span begin="03:57.576" end="03:58.094">I'll</span> <span begin="03:58.125" end="03:58.853">defy</span> <span begin="03:58.853" end="03:58.961">the</span> <span begin="03:58.961" end="03:59.424">sys</span><span begin="03:59.424" end="04:00.008">tem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让我喘口气，我便要反抗这系统</span></p><p begin="04:00.536" end="04:04.797" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L77"><span begin="04:00.736" end="04:01.112">I</span> <span begin="04:01.112" end="04:01.223">sup</span><span begin="04:01.300" end="04:01.878">pose</span> <span begin="04:01.878" end="04:02.231">it's</span> <span begin="04:02.231" end="04:02.455">al</span><span begin="04:02.455" end="04:02.934">most</span> <span begin="04:02.965" end="04:03.296">time</span> <span begin="04:03.338" end="04:03.464">to</span> <span begin="04:03.464" end="04:04.052">say</span> <span begin="04:04.087" end="04:04.321">good</span><span begin="04:04.321" end="04:04.797">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我想，差不多该道声晚安了</span></p><p begin="04:05.554" end="04:10.768" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L78"><span begin="04:05.754" end="04:05.978">To</span><span begin="04:05.978" end="04:06.249">mor</span><span begin="04:06.249" end="04:06.506">row</span> <span begin="04:06.543" end="04:07.009">there'll</span> <span begin="04:07.048" end="04:07.168">be</span> <span begin="04:07.168" end="04:07.810">sights</span> <span begin="04:07.836" end="04:07.964">to</span> <span begin="04:07.964" end="04:08.499">see</span> <span begin="04:08.755" end="04:08.989">and</span> <span begin="04:08.989" end="04:09.371"